*3</font>区域的首个目标击退<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格（若目标处于末端则仅击退<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格，若目标为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"物品\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">物品</font></span></span>]则造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">100%</font>伤害）；所有目标被自身下次攻击时，最终受到伤害提高一半，此效果持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-2 直线.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/n8cvpq9x5se16158o0omj5xk2zsmx1e.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-2_%E7%9B%B4%E7%BA%BF.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"79\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/n8cvpq9x5se16158o0omj5xk2zsmx1e.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-2_%E7%9B%B4%E7%BA%BF.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/cf/n8cvpq9x5se16158o0omj5xk2zsmx1e.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"148\" data-file-height=\"147\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left; width:80px;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"skill_icon_box\">\n<div data-type=\"@悬浮框/技能2\" data-name=\"阿尔德法印\" class=\"bili-tt skill_icon_bg\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6